## Deploy

`src/main.ts` exports `handler` (built to `dist/main.js`). Packaging and
deployment (SAM, CDK, Terraform, the AWS console, ...) are **not** part of
this fleet's tooling — wire `dist/main.js`'s `handler` export into whichever
Lambda function definition your infrastructure declares. Set the function's
runtime to Node.js 24.x and its handler to `main.handler`.

```bash
pnpm build                                        # library first (turbo orders it)
pnpm --filter @m3l-automation/__SCRIPT_NAME__ build
```

